"Reisemanagement mit besonderem Fokus auf Familienreisen, Wildtier-Safaris, "
"Spezialinteressen-Touren und romantische Flitterwochen."

msgid ""
"All our holidays are tailor-made and we pride ourselves in matching your "
"holiday travel preparations arrangements to your exact needs and special "
"interests. Our vacations are all carefully designed so that your holiday "
"experience is one of a kind, leaving memories that are only yours to keep!"
